### Check server health
GET {{api_host}}/health
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

### Check server readyness
GET {{api_host}}/ready
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

### Get OpenAPI specification
GET {{api_host}}/openapi
Accept: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000


